    "notes": "Single session December 21, 1960 at Van Gelder Studio, Englewood Cliffs. Booker Little (trumpet) only on 'Miss Ann'. 'Tenderly' is Dolphy unaccompanied on alto saxophone. Recorded the same day as Ornette Coleman's Free Jazz session. Original release 1962 on New Jazz NJ 8270. Reissue bonus track 'Serene' not included in original track listing."
